					"name": "Code of Honor (Halfling Hospitality)",
					"reference": "B163,MA53",
					"local_notes": "Halflings hold hospitality as sacred. A Halfling must offer food and drink to those who come in peace when able, and any who share a meal in good faith are under their protection for the duration of that meeting. Violence is forbidden during such hospitality unless the guest first breaks it through betrayal, theft, or attack. Likewise, a Halfling must respect the hospitality of others when they are the guest, honoring the safety and goodwill of the shared table.",
