				{
					"id": "taxNdtRvXPGUeJp8b",
					"name": "Halfling Fortune",
					"local_notes": "🍀 Halfling Fortune [3 Points]\nOnce per in-game hour, the Halfling may re-roll any critical failure.\nThe second result must be accepted, even if it's another critical failure.\nMay be used in combat, skill checks, defense rolls, etc.\nThis represents the uncanny luck many Halflings seem to possess. Cannot be stacked with Luck advantage or other re-roll mechanics.",
