					"id": "tuC6KIbXCaSriEHbo",
					"name": "Racial Perk: Tough Feet",
					"local_notes": "Your feet are tough, as if you were wearing light foot coverings even when barefoot. This grants no DR, but your feet enjoy protection against the environment comparable to that provided by moccasins. This lets you walk on rocks and stiff, dry grass, avoid frozen toes, etc., exempting you from Hiking or Running skill penalties the GM assigns for going barefoot.",
