					"local_notes": "Once per in-game day, if you sleep at least 4 hours, you may receive a cryptic or symbolic dream revealing information relevant to your current goals. No roll is required to receive a vision, but you must make a Will roll upon waking—on success, you recall the dream clearly; on failure, the dream is muddled or forgotten. The guidance may reflect alternate timelines and is not guaranteed to be literal or current.",
